+  ** heads instead. Thus valid publication needs no duplicate-address walk.
+  ** Keep the defensive stale-head cleanup, charging each removed node once;
+  ** stop at the first valid head so freeing N valid runs costs O(N), not O(N^2).
+  ** The same cycle check also bounds a deliberately malformed stale prefix. */
   while (*pp) {
